{{Factionpage|

| description = Climbing up to the [[Ak'Anon | Library Mechanimagica]] can be dangerous in the dark, but gnomish spellcasters do this when quite young where they seek the yellow robes offered by Juline Urncaller the Enchanter Guildmaster, Wuggan Aeusphere the Magician Guildmaster and Tobon Starpyre the Wizard Guildmaster.  The Eldritch collective is actively opposed to the Evil Gnomes of the [[Dark Reflection]] and the Dark Elf Necromancers and Shadowknights of [[The Dead]] in Neriak.  They are allied with the [[Gem Choppers]] and support the gnomish [[King Ak'Anon (Faction)|King Ak'Anon]].

